{"id":"d306b38c7e186f86","group":"89","path":"89/89-ax-gl-axioms.md","title":"GL Axiom System","display":"ax-gl-axioms — GL Axiom System","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ax-gl-axioms","aliases":["89-ax-gl-axioms"],"display":"ax-gl-axioms — GL Axiom System","depends_on":["[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","[[89-df-k-axiom]]","[[89-df-lob-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ax-gl-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ax-gl-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-gl-axioms — GL Axiom System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the modal-language\npropositional-tautology set from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> are the\nK and Löb schemas from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是下述定义的 GL 公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 在此为区分逻辑系统的下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K}\">\\(\\mathrm{K}\\)</span> : K公理 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box p \\rightarrow p) \\rightarrow \\Box p\">\\(\\Box(\\Box p \\rightarrow p) \\rightarrow \\Box p\\)</span> : Löb公理 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li>4 公理在 GL 中可导出，不作为独立原始公理加入</li>\n<li>可证性逻辑的公理系统</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-propositional-tautology","status":"resolved","id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-k-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-propositional-tautology","status":"resolved","id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the modal-language\npropositional-tautology set from [[89-df-propositional-tautology]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are the\nK and Löb schemas from [[89-df-k-axiom]] and [[89-df-lob-axiom]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are the\nK and Löb schemas from [[89-df-k-axiom]] and [[89-df-lob-axiom]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{K}$ : K公理 (see [[89-df-k-axiom]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\Box(\\Box p \\rightarrow p) \\rightarrow \\Box p$ : Löb公理 (see [[89-df-lob-axiom]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box p \\rightarrow p) \\rightarrow \\Box p","display":false}],"bytes":1175,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-435","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-ax-gl-axioms]]"}],"outgoing":["81d2de5abb2876b6","97dd3729fefd2e30","491579297d817026"]}